<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #F8FAFC; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
        .wrapper { width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; background-color: #F8FAFC; padding-bottom: 60px; padding-top: 60px; }
        .main { background-color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; border-spacing: 0; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid #bdbdbd; }
        .header { padding: 40px 0; text-align: center; background-color: #FFFFFF; }
        .content { padding: 0 50px 40px 50px; text-align: center; }
        .icon-circle { width: 70px; height: 70px; background-color: #C90000; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center; line-height: 70px; }
        h1 { color: #111111; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; margin: 0 0 15px 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
        p { color: #64748B; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 25px 0; font-weight: 500; }
        .button { display: inline-block; padding: 16px 45px; background-color: #C90000; color: #FFFFFF !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 14px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 30px; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(201, 0, 0, 0.15); }
        .footer { padding: 30px 50px; text-align: center; background-color: #FDFDFD; border-top: 1px solid #F1F5F9; }
        .footer-text { color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; }
        .support-box { background-color: #F8FAFC; border: 1px solid #F1F5F9; border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .support-text { font-size: 13px; color: #475569; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; }
        .link-alt { color: #C90000; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <center class="wrapper">
        <table class="main" width="100%">
            <tr>
                <td class="header">
                    <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Mototrad" width="140" style="display: block; margin: 0 auto;">
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="content">
                    <div class="icon-circle">
                        <img src="https://img.icons8.com/ios-filled/35/ffffff/lock-security.png" style="vertical-align: middle; padding-top: 17px;">
                    </div>
                    <h1>Reset Your Password</h1>
                    <p>Dear {{name}},</p>
                    <p>We received a request to reset the password for your Mototrad Account. You can proceed with changing your password by clicking the button below. This link will expire in 2 hours.</p>
                    
                    <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="button">Reset My Password</a>
 
                    <p style="font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 5px;">Can't see the button? Use the link:</p>
                    <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="link-alt">Click here to reset</a>
 
                    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #94A3B8; font-weight: 500; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 25px;">If you did not request a password change, please ignore this email. Your current password will remain completely secure.</p>
 
                    <div class="support-box">
                        <p class="support-text">If you have additional questions, please refer to the <a href="#" style="color: #C90000; text-decoration: none;">Support Center</a>.</p>
                    </div>
 
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #111111; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 5px;">Yours sincerely,</p>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #C90000; font-weight: 800;">The Mototrad Team</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="footer">
                    <p class="footer-text">&copy; {{year}} Mototrad Marketplace. All rights reserved.</p>
                    <p class="footer-text" style="margin-top: 5px;">Dubai, United Arab Emirates</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </center>
</body>
</html>
